! Add a new Hyper_R modifier and move Hyper_L from mod4 to mod3
! add mod3 = Hyper_L Hyper_R
! add mod4 = Super_L Super_R


!! keycode 112 is Page Up. It used to be remapped to Insert because the
!! Adv360 has no Insert key anywhere in its default layout. Insert now
!! lives on Fn + PgUp (function1 layer, profile 4) instead, so Page Up is free.
! keycode 112 = Insert
